{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a small village in the northern United States, there are several extraterrestrials who mimic local residents. Your task is to determine who is who and eliminate the aliens. Assisting you in this perilous endeavor are an old pickup truck and a camera. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I Want to Believe</strong> is a first-person action game with elements of detective work, simulation, stealth, freedom of action, and driving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/8222379f98f45d1c186bff1ad1e504e3.poster.avif?t=1758120582\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/8222379f98f45d1c186bff1ad1e504e3.webm?t=1758120582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/8222379f98f45d1c186bff1ad1e504e3.mp4?t=1758120582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2x2 km open world. Your pickup truck is your best friend \u2014 it\u2019ll get you anywhere you need, haul cargo, and even play a full country radio station made just for the game, complete with a voiced radio host.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/e07864df917b98101a31c883e1f31862.poster.avif?t=1758120582\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/e07864df917b98101a31c883e1f31862.webm?t=1758120582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/e07864df917b98101a31c883e1f31862.mp4?t=1758120582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re new in town. Aside from being a sharp-eyed detective, your character\u2019s only skill is driving a pickup \u2014 so you\u2019ll earn money the way life prepared you for. Make cash while scouting the area for your investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/6bbb5ad1ded9b8374f780ceae4c16952.poster.avif?t=1758120582\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/6bbb5ad1ded9b8374f780ceae4c16952.webm?t=1758120582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/6bbb5ad1ded9b8374f780ceae4c16952.mp4?t=1758120582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The town has its own eccentrics. Or maybe they\u2019re not crazy at all, just people who know more than the folks around them. Join their club \u2014 they might have the info you need to crack the case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/a6cd52a53677e0c6a67c3d3bcc2c29e1.poster.avif?t=1758120582\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/a6cd52a53677e0c6a67c3d3bcc2c29e1.webm?t=1758120582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/a6cd52a53677e0c6a67c3d3bcc2c29e1.mp4?t=1758120582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your instant-print camera is your second best friend. Snap anything that looks suspicious. Ask locals if they\u2019ve seen anything strange. Hunt for clues and pin them to your crime board to piece together the puzzle and expose aliens disguised as humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/6472a8eed93a532a71f5404e8d5b58de.poster.avif?t=1758120582\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/6472a8eed93a532a71f5404e8d5b58de.webm?t=1758120582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/6472a8eed93a532a71f5404e8d5b58de.mp4?t=1758120582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate the aliens \u2014 quietly. You don\u2019t need witnesses or police finding evidence of your crimes. Even if you\u2019re saving humanity, no one will believe you. Don\u2019t leave behind blood, shells, or bodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/2b9d6eaa8d6fa810013aff25bbaee6fa.poster.avif?t=1758120582\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/2b9d6eaa8d6fa810013aff25bbaee6fa.webm?t=1758120582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/2b9d6eaa8d6fa810013aff25bbaee6fa.mp4?t=1758120582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if all that\u2019s not enough \u2014 explore the area and find other ways to have fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom of action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Figure out what to do and how to do it on your own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic car physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersion and atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulation of many aspects of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cool fully-fledged radio system</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Kill an alien","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2739150/a103db1b993683670ad2064834d1738591eb64f0.jpg"},{"name":"Murderer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2739150/ced01c3957999f44cad2efa96ac47990d5611628.jpg"},{"name":"Point blank","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2739150/ffe4339bd38fa84591013cf458e15793004108d5.jpg"},{"name":"Deadly accident","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2739150/3bae76eddbcd23949f9d0257398e54651c775722.jpg"},{"name":"Genocide","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2739150/a49cd9566109d00a06b7e537a33e869fd4600bbf.jpg"},{"name":"Too much truth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2739150/0c4a169a99d396aae94c681130f277542ccdaba4.jpg"},{"name":"Gallery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2739150/db42ce85928070edcf6183b9df5826d687fdb916.jpg"},{"name":"True detective","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2739150/6e3fffd139260134d23a3908bb383eac25755585.jpg"},{"name":"Finish the game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2739150/bc25de84a048cb5e9bf5591a91b7c883c82ce572.jpg"},{"name":"No tips","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2739150/cfe8e3b6a52e4452b4e4000ea423a31608f8b622.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2739150?t=1758120582","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758120582","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/a86405535a1529c20867926084088d7ad5587c25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758120582","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/a86405535a1529c20867926084088d7ad5587c25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758120582","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"You can kill an NPC by the gun or by your vehicle."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a small village in the northern United States, there are several extraterrestrials who mimic local residents. Your task is to determine who is who and eliminate the aliens. Assisting you in this perilous endeavor are an old pickup truck and a camera. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I Want to Believe</strong> is a first-person action game with elements of detective work, simulation, stealth, freedom of action, and driving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/8222379f98f45d1c186bff1ad1e504e3.poster.avif?t=1758120582\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/8222379f98f45d1c186bff1ad1e504e3.webm?t=1758120582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/8222379f98f45d1c186bff1ad1e504e3.mp4?t=1758120582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2x2 km open world. Your pickup truck is your best friend \u2014 it\u2019ll get you anywhere you need, haul cargo, and even play a full country radio station made just for the game, complete with a voiced radio host.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/e07864df917b98101a31c883e1f31862.poster.avif?t=1758120582\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/e07864df917b98101a31c883e1f31862.webm?t=1758120582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/e07864df917b98101a31c883e1f31862.mp4?t=1758120582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re new in town. Aside from being a sharp-eyed detective, your character\u2019s only skill is driving a pickup \u2014 so you\u2019ll earn money the way life prepared you for. Make cash while scouting the area for your investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/6bbb5ad1ded9b8374f780ceae4c16952.poster.avif?t=1758120582\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/6bbb5ad1ded9b8374f780ceae4c16952.webm?t=1758120582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/6bbb5ad1ded9b8374f780ceae4c16952.mp4?t=1758120582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The town has its own eccentrics. Or maybe they\u2019re not crazy at all, just people who know more than the folks around them. Join their club \u2014 they might have the info you need to crack the case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/a6cd52a53677e0c6a67c3d3bcc2c29e1.poster.avif?t=1758120582\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/a6cd52a53677e0c6a67c3d3bcc2c29e1.webm?t=1758120582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/a6cd52a53677e0c6a67c3d3bcc2c29e1.mp4?t=1758120582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your instant-print camera is your second best friend. Snap anything that looks suspicious. Ask locals if they\u2019ve seen anything strange. Hunt for clues and pin them to your crime board to piece together the puzzle and expose aliens disguised as humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/6472a8eed93a532a71f5404e8d5b58de.poster.avif?t=1758120582\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/6472a8eed93a532a71f5404e8d5b58de.webm?t=1758120582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/6472a8eed93a532a71f5404e8d5b58de.mp4?t=1758120582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate the aliens \u2014 quietly. You don\u2019t need witnesses or police finding evidence of your crimes. Even if you\u2019re saving humanity, no one will believe you. Don\u2019t leave behind blood, shells, or bodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/2b9d6eaa8d6fa810013aff25bbaee6fa.poster.avif?t=1758120582\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/2b9d6eaa8d6fa810013aff25bbaee6fa.webm?t=1758120582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/extras/2b9d6eaa8d6fa810013aff25bbaee6fa.mp4?t=1758120582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if all that\u2019s not enough \u2014 explore the area and find other ways to have fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom of action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Figure out what to do and how to do it on your own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic car physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersion and atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulation of many aspects of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cool fully-fledged radio system</p></li></ul>","developers":["Fang's Lab"],"dlc":[3157980],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739150/header.jpg?t=1758120582","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2739150/2042300440/a8384171a361de6c24048c667b5f19e781bac2ab/1755001542/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755019111","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_